{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11232010.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11232010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11232010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1123201001:0":{"text":"지난번에 하쉬르를 만나러 갔다 온 지 벌써 시간이 많이 지났네요...","source_cn":"好像离上次拜访哈什尔已经有段时间了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57EB99AFA7540CCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1123201002:0":{"text":"마스터, 하쉬르를 보러 가야 하지 않을까요?","source_cn":"主人，我们是不是该去看看哈什尔了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x904977FDA52C4F0B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 하쉬르를 보러 가야 하지 않을까요?","female":"마스터, 하쉬르를 보러 가야 하지 않을까요?","variant_male_record_index":"126006","variant_female_record_index":"126007","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11232020.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11232020","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11232020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1123202001:0":{"text":"멈춰! 이 멍청한 것, 무슨 짓을 한 거지? 아프게 했잖아!","source_cn":"住手！你这笨熊在干什么！你弄疼它了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BA7E306DFF9AEC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1123202002:0":{"text":"하지만 계속 반항해서...","source_cn":"可是它一直反抗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1A937655CCF8CFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1123202003:0":{"text":"이렇게 거칠게 구니 당연히 반항하지! 먼저 신뢰부터 쌓아야 하는 법이다!","source_cn":"你这样粗鲁它当然会反抗！你需要跟它建立信任！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9F9E5068B4504F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:哈什尔":{"text":"하쉬르","source":"哈什尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:驯兽师萨克":{"text":"조련사 사크","source":"驯兽师萨克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep1/quest_story/11232030.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11232030","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11232030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1123203001:1":{"text":"어, 어떡하죠. 도망갔는데요!","source_cn":"我、我该怎么做，它跑掉了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87CC1EC470994210","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123203002:1":{"text":"바꿔서 생각해 보거라. 너라도 도망가고 싶었겠지!","source_cn":"换做我也会想跑开的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90F2C5EBAF8C0113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1123203002":{"text":"바꿔서 생각해 보거라. 너라도 도망가고 싶었겠지!","source_cn":"换做我也会想跑开的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90F2C5EBAF8C0113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1123203003:1":{"text":"도마뱀이 뭐 때문에 놀랐는지 이 어르신의 텐트를 부숴버렸는데 어떻게 멈춰야 할지 모르겠어요.","source_cn":"我的蜥蜴不知道因为什么受惊了，还撞破了这位老人的帐篷，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F1C65A40BF22960","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1123203004:1":{"text":"놀란 게 아니라 뭔가 신기한 것을 본 거겠지. 방금 네 행동 때문에 무서워한 거고! 알겠느냐!","source_cn":"它并不是受惊，而是看到什么好奇的东西，是你刚才的动作让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B20118F976965D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1123203005:1":{"text":"이런 멍청이가 어떻게 조련사가 된 건지, 원!","source_cn":"真搞不懂你这种笨熊是怎么当上驯兽师的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED964B96F981003B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1123203006:1":{"text":"죄, 죄송합니다... 어떻게 해야 할까요?","source_cn":"对……对不起，我该怎么做？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91239B9EF386C268","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1123203007:1":{"text":"다른 녀석에게 물어봐. 네 녀석을 가르칠 시간 따위는 없으니까.","source_cn":"问问别人吧，我可没闲心教你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65F3AD2BA3DF20F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1123203007":{"text":"다른 녀석에게 물어봐. 네 녀석을 가르칠 시간 따위는 없으니까.","source_cn":"问问别人吧，我可没闲心教你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65F3AD2BA3DF20F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1123203008:1":{"text":"쳇, 욕이나 몇 마디 퍼부어 준 것뿐이지!","source_cn":"哼，我只是想骂他几句而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF68B11639892E117","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1123203009:1":{"text":"아, 안 돼요! 부족에서 제 도마뱀이 도망간 걸 알면 분명 혼날 거예요!","source_cn":"不，不！我的蜥蜴要跑掉了，如果让氏族知道我一定会受罚的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54DC0A06DF695DE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1123203009":{"text":"아, 안 돼요! 부족에서 제 도마뱀이 도망간 걸 알면 분명 혼날 거예요!","source_cn":"不，不！我的蜥蜴要跑掉了，如果让氏族知道我一定会受罚的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54DC0A06DF695DE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1123203010:1":{"text":"그 도마뱀은 이미 멀리 도망갔어, 게다가 네가 신경 쓸 일도 아니고.","source_cn":"省省吧，那只蜥蜴已经跑远了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC72CDC1F3D1BC4E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1123203011:1":{"text":"뭐 물론... 너희가 다른 작은 동물을 잘 이용해보면 다시 눈길을 끌어올 수도 있고.","source_cn":"除非……你们利用好其他小动物的话，也许还能吸引回它的注意力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x531DCC943C4ED24C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"(도와주겠다고 한다)","source_cn":"（表示愿意帮忙）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC568CB05EB1AF645","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(도와주겠다고 한다)","female":"(도와주겠다고 한다)","variant_male_record_index":"64400","variant_female_record_index":"64401","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"(하쉬르의 의견을 묻는다)","source_cn":"（询问哈什尔的意见）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD9723E826E89BCA3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(하쉬르의 의견을 묻는다)","female":"(하쉬르의 의견을 묻는다)","variant_male_record_index":"64402","variant_female_record_index":"64403","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"하지만 이미 가르쳐줬잖아","source_cn":"但是你已经在教他了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x76FA0966C5A36459","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"하지만 이미 가르쳐줬잖아","female":"하지만 이미 가르쳐줬잖아","variant_male_record_index":"64398","variant_female_record_index":"64399","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"(상황을 물어본다)","source_cn":"（询问情况）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7DA89765EF830458","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(상황을 물어본다)","female":"(상황을 물어본다)","variant_male_record_index":"64396","variant_female_record_in